Subject: Consumer grievance regarding {{issueType}} — Order {{orderId}}

To,
National Consumer Helpline / Concerned Consumer Protection Authority

Respected Sir/Madam,

I am {{complainantName}} residing at {{location}}. I purchased {{product}} on {{purchaseDate}} from {{seller}} (Order / Invoice: {{orderId}}).

Issue: {{issueType}}
Details: {{description}}

I have already contacted the seller/platform and have not received a satisfactory resolution. I request you to register this complaint, direct the opposite party to {{reliefSought}}, and keep me informed of the docket status.

This draft is prepared with NyayaSetu guidance only. I will file it myself on the official portal consumerhelpline.gov.in. NyayaSetu does not file complaints on my behalf.

Thank you.
{{complainantName}}

Subject: Civic grievance — {{issueType}} at {{location}}

To,
The Municipal Commissioner / Concerned Civic Authority
Copy: CPGRAMS Public Grievance Portal

Respected Sir/Madam,

